            /** Group frame to move this node into, by an existing group's short id or UUID, or null to move it out of its group to the top level. Omit to leave membership unchanged. The node keeps its canvas spot unless position is also given (absolute), and a frame it joins grows to wrap it. Rejected on group nodes (frames do not nest), on a notes node joining a group, on a node attached to another node (a pinned label follows its host), and for a group this same changeset creates or removes. */
            group?: (string | null) | undefined;
            /** HTTPS URL of an image, video, or audio file that replaces the media of a static image, video, or audio node in place; the node keeps its id, edges, group, and label (unless group or label is also given). The file is copied onto Flora's CDN as on an add. Mutually exclusive with asset_id, prompt, model, params, document, text, size, and fit_text. */
            content_url?: string | undefined;
            /** A ready asset in this project's workspace that replaces the media of a static image, video, or audio node in place, keeping the node's id, edges, group, and label (unless group or label is also given). Its kind must match the node's. The asset is referenced, not copied or deleted. Mutually exclusive with content_url, prompt, model, params, document, text, size, and fit_text. */
